{"product_id":"strangers-on-a-train-patricia-highsmith","title":"Strangers on a Train: Patricia Highsmith","description":"\u003cp\u003eWITH A NEW INTRODUCTION BY PAULA HAWKINS, AUTHOR OF GIRL ON A TRAIN\"Hey! Cheeses, what an idea! I kill your wife and you kill my father! We meet on a train, see, and nobody knows we know each other! Perfect alibis! Catch?\"From this moment, almost against his conscious will, Guy Haines is trapped in a nightmare of shared guilt and an insidious merging of personalities. The psychologists would call it folie a deux...Strangers on a Train was Patricia Highsmith's first novel, and adapted into a classic film by Alfred Hitchcock.'A true original in crime fiction' The Times\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Patricia Highsmith\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781784876777\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45354153902233,"sku":"2RF9781784876777","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68123bdc1074a-Strangers-on-a-Train-Patricia-Highsmith-Patricia-Highsmith-_1.jpg?v=1748277962","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/strangers-on-a-train-patricia-highsmith","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}